nts with acute and chronic liver disease: a prospective study</article-title><source>Hepatology</source><year>1992</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>277A</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Watanabe</surname><given-names>FD</given-names></name><name><surname>Shackleton</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldman</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Arnaout</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hewitt</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Colquhoun</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name><name><surname>Vierling</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Busuttil</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name><name><surname>Demetriou</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Treatment of acetaminophen-induced fulminant hepatic failure with a bioartificial liver</article-title><source>Transplant Proc</source><year>1997</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>487</fpage><lpage>488</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9123096</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Watanabe</surname><given-names>FD</given-names></name><name><surname>Mullon</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hewitt</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name><name><surname>Arkadopoulos</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kahaku</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Eguchi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Khalili</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Arnaout</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Shackleton</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Rozqa</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Solomon</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Demetriou</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical experience with a bioartificial liver in the treatment of severe liver failure: a phase I clinical trial</article-title><source>Ann Surg</source><year>1997</year><volume>225</volume><fpage>484</fpage><lpage>491</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9193176</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bland</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>An introduction to medical statistics</source><year>1995</year><edition>2nd ed</edition><publisher-loc>Oxford</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Oxford University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>O'Grady</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute liver failure</article-title><source>J R Coll Physicians Lond</source><year>1997</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>603</fpage><lpage>607</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9409490</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Riordan</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cause and prognosis in acute liver failure</article-title><source>Liver Transpl Surg</source><year>1999</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>86</fpage><lpage>89</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9873098</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Riordan</surname><